### Title:
"Join US" picture is clickable but does not lead to SIGN UP page

### Environment:
- Browser: Google Chrome 120
- OS: Windows 10
- Version: Demo / Test

### Preconditions:
- User is not logged in

### Steps to Reproduce:
1. Open the application from the URL
2. Scroll down
3. Click on the "Join US" picture

### Expected Result:
- The "Join US" picture in the Sign Up Now section is clickable and redirects the user to the SIGN UP page.

### Actual Result:
- The "Join US" picture is not clickable and does not redirect to the SIGN UP page.

